            "label": "Edition PDFs",
            "inline_text": null,
            "content_html": "<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/in.ernet.dli.2015.383504\">1889 on Archive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=uc1.b4023759&amp;seq=5\">1889 on HathiTrust</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/ksu.p2819.banaskadambaripa0000pete/mode/2up\">1900 (text) on Archive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/india.history.resource.78130/page/n3/mode/2up\">1899 (intro/notes) on Archive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/kadambari01bana/page/n7/mode/2up\">1885 on Archive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=hvd.32044092178649&amp;seq=7\">1885 on HathiTrust</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://play.google.com/books/reader?id=tbMIAAAAQAAJ&amp;pg=GBS.PP8\">1883 on Google Books</a></li>\n</ul>\n"
        },
